hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"146","Yastaeidh bialllah ¤--------------------------------- ¤ Says: I seek refuge in Allah."
"147","Yantahi eamma shaka fih ¤--------------------------------- ¤ Then you should desist from doing what you are in doubt about."
"148","Āmantu billāhi wa Rusulih. ¤ ---------------------------------¤ I believe in Allah and His Messengers. ¤ ¤ After these words, recite this prayer: ¤ ¤ Huwa ‘l-Awwalu wa ‘l-Ākhir, waẓ-Ẓāhiru wal-Bāṭin, wa huwa bikulli shay'in `Alīm. ¤--------------------------------- ¤ (Recite the Ayat) He is the First and the Last, the Most High and the Most Near. And He is the Knower of all things."
